>2fd443cd-f7e8-4097-945e-2a569bde6c6b</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:2fd443cd-f7e8-4097-945e-2a569bde6c6b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:2fd443cd-f7e8-4097-945e-2a569bde6c6b\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gerringothe_Thorm\" title=\"Gerringothe Thorm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png/38px-Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png/50px-Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gerringothe Thorm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gerringothe_Thorm\" title=\"Gerringothe Thorm\">Gerringothe Thorm</a> in the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reithwin_Tollhouse\" title=\"Reithwin Tollhouse\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reithwin Tollhouse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Reithwin_Tollhouse\" title=\"Reithwin Tollhouse\">Reithwin Tollhouse</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[An unsigned writ suggests a counterfeit-in-progress; whoever made it was planning to trade illegally within the tollhouse.]\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In order to receive the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Signed_Trade_Visa\" title=\"Signed Trade Visa\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/BOOK_SignedTradeVisa_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-BOOK_SignedTradeVisa_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/BOOK_SignedTradeVisa_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-BOOK_SignedTradeVisa_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/BOOK_SignedTradeVisa_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-BOOK_SignedTradeVisa_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/BOOK_SignedTradeVisa_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-BOOK_SignedTradeVisa_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/BOOK_SignedTradeVisa_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Signed_Trade_Visa\" title=\"Signed Trade Visa\">Signed Trade Visa</a>, the encounter with Gerringothe must be resolved by giving her at least <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/Gold_Pile_Single_Item_Image.png/23px-Gold_Pile_Single_Item_Image.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f5/Gold_Pile_Single_Item_Image.png/35px-Gold_Pile_Single_Item_Image.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f5/Gold_Pile_Single_Item_Image.png/46px-Gold_Pile_Single_Item_Image.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"5000 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/Gold_Pile_Single_Item_Image.png/23px-Gold_Pile_Single_Item_Image.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f5/Gold_Pile_Single_Item_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 5000 gp, and she must have this item in her inventory when paying the toll.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203117\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.066 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.069 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2487/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 36628/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9321/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1104892/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   55.684      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   55.684      1 -total\n 50.61%   28.183     10 Template:Icon_text\n 45.68%   25.438     29 Template:Trim\n 17.24%    9.601      2 Template:Uid\n 15.05%    8.381      4 Template:Icon_link\n 12.21%    6.801      1 Template:RarityItem\n 12.14%    6.761      1 Template:Main_only\n 11.60%    6.